| **RCP** {#rcp} | *Relational‑Computability Principle* | A pattern **P** is [algorithmically predictable](#rcp "epistemic:measures") iff its description length ≤ a function of information density **I** and link coherence **C** in the [relational graph](#rcp "ontological:composes") sustaining it. |
| **MPDC** {#mpdc} | *Meta‑Pattern Decidability Conjecture* | No [finite observer](#mpdc "geometric:embedded_in") inside **R** can prove that their accessible pattern‑space is complete. [Blind‑spots](#mpdc "symmetric:limits") are inevitable. |
