Your two options (cling to biology vs. integrate) might not even be choices in any meaningful sense. The integration might happen through us, not by us. Market forces, social pressures, the simple need to remain relevant and capable - these might drive integration as surely as [thermodynamics](#physical-laws "geometric:causes") drove cellular evolution.

